      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I dont know if related exactly but I swear lately seeing other players jump is jittery now. Standing right in front of someone as they jump does not update their position fast enough so it looks very rough when it tries to interpolate it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
