  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-10-08T01:00:59.772Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Since the update on October 2nd rolled out, I noticed several network related issues. I'm using VRChat via SteamPlay in VR, so I dunno if this affects many other users:\n- Sometimes avatars won't load immediately, but hang on 0% (without any other players in the world) for about 30 seconds or so, before suddenly loading in from 0 to 100% in a second.\n- Some portals will get stuck with the [world] [owner] [access] text and be unusable.\n- Some portals will load, but when walking through them, the client might network freeze. E.g., I can't move anymore, but still look around with my HMD and use the menu, although it won't allow me to go home or to any other world. This requires a restart of VRChat to fix then.",
